{"id":"58e12abc814f8c50","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded.md","title":"Witnessing Theorem for Bounded Arithmetic","display":"thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded — Witnessing Theorem for Bounded Arithmetic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded","aliases":["72-thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded"],"display":"thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded — Witnessing Theorem for Bounded Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[72-df-s2-theory]]","[[72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded]]","[[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]","[[72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function]]","[[72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.6; §3.2–3.2.2","source_printed_pages":"106–107, 127–130","source_pdf_pages":"118–119, 139–142","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"Source theorem/corollary and witnessing proof sketch read; every witness-code and PIND transformation not independently formalized","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-witnessing-theorem-bounded — Witnessing Theorem for Bounded Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"690ac0b5f3b63c49\" href=\"?note=690ac0b5f3b63c49\" title=\"72-df-s2-theory\">72-df-s2-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f5fd01e8505fc1f\" href=\"?note=7f5fd01e8505fc1f\" title=\"72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded\">72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75e696732042abd2\" href=\"?note=75e696732042abd2\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy\">72-df-polynomial-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"633c2d970d6483e6\" href=\"?note=633c2d970d6483e6\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function\">72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09833e5945eb7509\" href=\"?note=09833e5945eb7509\" title=\"72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate\">72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.6; §3.2–3.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"106–107, 127–130"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"118–119, 139–142"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Source theorem/corollary and witnessing proof sketch read; every witness-code and PIND transformation not independently formalized"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1\">\\(i\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_2^i,\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(S_2^i,\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"690ac0b5f3b63c49\" href=\"?note=690ac0b5f3b63c49\" title=\"72-df-s2-theory\">72-df-s2-theory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 是互异变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b\">\\(A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b\\)</span> 的自由变量包含于所显示变量中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 是标准自然数结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p},\\Delta_i^p\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p},\\Delta_i^p\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"75e696732042abd2\" href=\"?note=75e696732042abd2\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy\">72-df-polynomial-hierarchy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"633c2d970d6483e6\" href=\"?note=633c2d970d6483e6\" title=\"72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function\">72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"09833e5945eb7509\" href=\"?note=09833e5945eb7509\" title=\"72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate\">72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为固定经典一阶可证性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(S_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p}\\;\n\\bigl[f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n,f(\\vec n)])\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(S_2^i\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists y\\;A(\\vec x,y)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p}\\;\n\\bigl[f:\\omega^k\\to\\omega\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\;(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\models A[\\vec n,f(\\vec n)])\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(S_2^i)=\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(S_2^i)=\\Delta_i^p.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(S_2^i)=\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(S_2^i)=\\Delta_i^p.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §3.2，印刷 pp. 127–130（PDF pp. 139–142），Theorem、Corollary 与 §3.2.2 Witnessing Lemma；反向可定义性用 §1.3.6 印刷 pp. 106–107（PDF pp. 118–119）。来源陈述已逐项比对。</li>\n<li>第一式保留原有选择函数结论：先用 Parikh 得到界项，再对存在式应用 Witnessing Lemma 并投影见证；它不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的见证唯一。第二式才是原书关于“可定义函数”的精确对应，需要独立上游中的存在唯一性条件。</li>\n<li>已阅读原书证明提纲与归纳安排，未逐步核验全部 witness 编码和 PIND 情形；保留不可无条件作为已核验依赖的标记。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-s2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-s2-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded","status":"resolved","id":"7f5fd01e8505fc1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-parikh-theorem-bounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"75e696732042abd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"633c2d970d6483e6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"09833e5945eb7509","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-s2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\geq1$，$k\\in\\omega$；$S_2^i,\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-s2-theory]]。$\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})$ 与 $y$ 是互异变量，$A(\\vec x,y)\\in\\Sigma_i^b$ 的自由变量包含于所显示变量中。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"75e696732042abd2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 是标准自然数结构；$\\mathbf{FP}^{\\Sigma_{i-1}^p},\\Delta_i^p$ 取 [[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"633c2d970d6483e6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)$、$\\mathrm{DeltaPredicates}_i(T)$ 分别取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-definable-function]]、[[72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate]]；$\\vdash$ 为固定经典一阶可证性。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-delta-bounded-definable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"09833e5945eb7509","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SigmaFunctions}_i(T)$、$\\mathrm{DeltaPredica